## List Contributions

this file describes the list Contributions feature.

1. It should open a Modal after clicking in the second button of the card in the [SavingJars.tsx](mdc:src/components/SavingJars.tsx)
2. The modal should have a close button
3. The modal should have the title "Historico {savingJar.name}"
4. list each contribution in a card showing value, date and partner
5. it should list add contributions from that saving jard
6. it should GET to '/contributions/saving-jar/{savingJarId}'
7. it should follow the layout located at [list-contribution.png](mdc:layout-images/list-contribution.png)
